********* Azure Authentication ***************
Main function of Azure AD is to authenticate user credential whenever user signs into a new device / service/ application.
* Authentication in Azure AD includes
		Self service password Reset
		Multi factor authentication
		Passwordless authentication <only for helpdesk people who can reset user password. System would allow them to login without password>
		
* Azure maintains banned password list in AD. If any users tries to give that password, AD won't accept such passwords.
  It is configurable under "Custom banned password".
* Custom password policy can be used to further protection against weak password.
* Passwordless auth mode , user biomentrics is used via "Windows Hello for bussiness", "FIDO2 security key".  

