***** Azure AD B2C (bussiness to consumer) service *****************************
B2C enables sign on to Azure AD apps using social acounts/ enterprise accounts/ local accounts. By doing so we can enhance user login 
experience with our own brand. 
* B2C uses standard based protocols for authentication . Ex- OpenId connect, OAuth2, SAML
* Azure B2C allows 50,000 active users per month. 
* In Azure AD B2C , a tenant represents the organization and a B2C tenant is different from Azure AD tenant. 
	
